    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d295-a2">

                <pb facs="0523" n="1483" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1483"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 915—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-08-17"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 17,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Consul, Liverpool:</hi></p>
                <p>Send following to Magee, minister, Stockholm:</p>
                <p>“Ask detention for extradition of Albert Erbers, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >alias</hi> Eberson, charged with attempted murder and forgery in Wisconsin,
                    now in Norway.”</p>
                <p>Wegner, district attorney, Milwaukee, says you know Erbers’ address. Inform
                    Magee.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
